    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1839" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄζω</span></b>  (A), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dry up, parch</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁπότε χρόα Σείριος ἄζει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Sc.</u>
					397
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Op.</u>
				587
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alc.
				39.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				779
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[αἴγειρος] ἀζομένη
			κεἰται</span> lies <i>drying</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.487
			</span></i>.</div>
